WEBVTT

00:00.960 --> 00:05.500
Say, you really don't look like a criminal.

00:05.500 --> 00:07.740
What did you do?

00:07.740 --> 00:09.540
Treason.

00:09.540 --> 00:13.840
Naturally, high treason is a crime punishable
by the death penalty.

00:15.610 --> 00:17.580
You'll accept this mission, will you not?

00:17.850 --> 00:19.470
Yes...

00:21.380 --> 00:22.620
Zed!

00:22.620 --> 00:24.240
Zed!

00:24.790 --> 00:26.410
Damn...

00:31.830 --> 00:39.570
Bokutachi wa mina kitto te o nobashiterun da

00:39.570 --> 00:46.530
Tooku tooi basho e to

00:59.890 --> 01:06.090
Kaze ni fukare aruite yuku

01:06.090 --> 01:13.060
Umarekita imi o shiritakute

01:13.270 --> 01:19.570
Tatoeba ushinau toki ga kitemo

01:19.570 --> 01:26.710
Dakishimeru koto ima, erabou

01:29.150 --> 01:36.560
Bokutachi wa mina kitto te o nobashiterun da

01:36.560 --> 01:42.530
Nakusenai mono ni mukatte

01:42.530 --> 01:50.170
Kagayaita yume dake o taguriyosenagara

01:50.170 --> 01:57.040
Tooku tooi basho e to

02:05.490 --> 02:09.420
Episode 20
Reunion

02:16.660 --> 02:19.370
Mmm, beautiful.

02:19.370 --> 02:22.270
She'll be the perfect sacrifice!

02:22.270 --> 02:26.070
Yeah, I'm sure Great Tusker will be delighted!

02:26.070 --> 02:29.530
Great Tusker's resurrection may be
sooner than we think!

02:32.950 --> 02:34.570
Sacrifice...

02:35.020 --> 02:38.320
You three get things in order for
the ceremony at the castle.

02:38.320 --> 02:41.820
I will put this woman through
the purification ritual.

02:41.820 --> 02:43.450
Right!

02:55.140 --> 02:56.470
Indeed...

02:56.470 --> 03:00.770
So, the one you seek is hiding
in our land, you say?

03:01.340 --> 03:05.250
Yes, one who commits treason against Zymot.

03:05.250 --> 03:09.050
He is an arch-criminal whom we have put
our utmost effort into finding.

03:09.050 --> 03:11.590
Then, go about as you please.

03:11.590 --> 03:15.040
You may even use our troops,
should the need strike you.

03:15.960 --> 03:17.930
I appreciate your generosity.

03:20.860 --> 03:24.970
We have just now obtained a new sacrifice.

03:24.970 --> 03:28.340
To show my respect for you,
the new king of Zymot,

03:28.340 --> 03:31.970
I shall permit you to witness our sacred rite.

03:32.540 --> 03:34.840
I am unworthy of such an honor.

03:39.310 --> 03:42.770
Then, we shall meet again
some other time, Hugh.

03:45.420 --> 03:47.260
You too, Moloch.

03:47.260 --> 03:49.220
Y..Yes, sir!

04:08.310 --> 04:11.280
Where are you, Keith?

04:13.950 --> 04:16.450
The escapee, Keith, has a shard
buried inside his body,

04:16.450 --> 04:19.910
which emanates a unique kind of energy.

04:20.320 --> 04:23.120
It is proof that he is a prisoner.

04:24.290 --> 04:30.400
Your right hand should be able
to feel that energy.

04:30.400 --> 04:32.030
Understood.

04:48.920 --> 04:51.040
He doesn't seem to be so far away.

05:06.100 --> 05:07.440
Hey, there.

05:07.440 --> 05:09.400
Looks like you're alive.

05:11.070 --> 05:14.210
Why didn't you run off?

05:14.210 --> 05:17.180
That was your chance for freedom.

05:19.180 --> 05:22.280
Even if I had run off, I'd still be in Tusk.

05:22.280 --> 05:25.150
I'd be done in before you know it.

05:25.150 --> 05:27.950
It seems like I'll be much safer with you.

05:28.990 --> 05:30.160
But more importantly,

05:30.160 --> 05:31.830
that girl Roya is in trouble.

05:31.830 --> 05:33.430
What?

05:33.430 --> 05:35.730
You idiot, why didn't you tell me so...

05:42.340 --> 05:46.970
Tell me now, exactly who are you after?

05:47.980 --> 05:52.940
There is no way you would come personally
to catch a petty criminal.

05:56.780 --> 05:58.590
His name is Zed.

05:58.590 --> 06:00.820
He is the owner of Amir Gaul.

06:00.820 --> 06:01.920
What?

06:01.920 --> 06:04.390
The owner of Amir Gaul, you say?

06:05.560 --> 06:07.100
I see...

06:07.100 --> 06:10.390
So, the one who possesses Amir Gaul
has appeared, has he?

06:11.370 --> 06:15.800
We have ordered you to gather the key spirits.

06:15.800 --> 06:19.100
I see you are following your
orders commendably.

06:21.540 --> 06:23.850
Please tell me one thing.

06:23.850 --> 06:27.550
It's regarding what the king said
about their sacrifice.

06:27.550 --> 06:31.510
Does this mean the beastmen do indeed
believe in the resurrection of Tusker?

06:32.520 --> 06:33.520
Correct.

06:33.520 --> 06:36.860
They believe that Tusker will be revived

06:36.860 --> 06:39.530
if they offer the blood of
shard casters as sacrifices,

06:39.530 --> 06:41.500
foolish though it may be.

06:42.500 --> 06:46.270
But it is merely a legend after all.

06:46.270 --> 06:49.140
However, it is necessary to make
use of these legends,

06:49.140 --> 06:51.810
in order to manipulate the beastmen.

06:51.810 --> 06:56.880
To that end, I installed a beastman
like Gari as "king".

06:56.880 --> 06:58.850
He is a figurehead.

06:58.850 --> 07:04.990
But I hear that Tusker's seal
remains on the altar.

07:04.990 --> 07:08.290
Could that not be evidence that
Tusker did in fact exist?

07:10.490 --> 07:13.430
Nothing more than a mere fairy tale.

07:13.430 --> 07:15.760
But it is true that, by gathering the key spirits,

07:15.760 --> 07:19.890
one can attain the power to
rule this entire world.

07:20.440 --> 07:22.240
That is why it is necessary

07:22.240 --> 07:25.870
that we gather and bring them under
our careful supervision.

07:27.580 --> 07:29.540
You understand, don't you, Hugh?

07:30.510 --> 07:33.140
Do not entertain any unwise ambitions.

07:43.890 --> 07:45.630
Want to lean on my shoulder?

07:45.630 --> 07:47.760
I refuse to owe you anything.

07:47.760 --> 07:49.730
Oh, okay.

07:49.730 --> 07:53.630
But this "sacrifice" stuff is total BS.

07:53.630 --> 07:55.930
I got to save Roya and quick.

07:56.670 --> 08:00.480
Say, is Roya your girl?

08:00.480 --> 08:02.640
Nah, it's not like that.

08:02.640 --> 08:06.080
I've got to protect her though.

08:06.080 --> 08:09.280
Ah, so, she's pretty important to you.

08:09.280 --> 08:11.910
Look, I'm telling you that's not how it...

08:12.790 --> 08:14.760
She's an important friend.

08:15.460 --> 08:17.080
Right?

08:43.250 --> 08:44.890
Hey...

08:44.890 --> 08:46.520
Get moving, quick.

08:46.520 --> 08:48.150
Right...

08:49.190 --> 08:50.490
Want to lean on my shoulder?

08:50.490 --> 08:52.290
I told you no!

08:58.770 --> 09:01.230
Do not entertain any unwise ambitions.

09:04.610 --> 09:08.710
There's no point in living without ambition.

09:08.710 --> 09:13.610
I will gather all the key spirits without fail.

09:13.610 --> 09:16.580
And when I do...

09:19.450 --> 09:24.160
Well then, let's round up as many soldiers
as we can as quickly as possible.

09:24.160 --> 09:25.230
No...

09:25.230 --> 09:27.760
I appreciate the offer,
but that will be unnecessary.

09:27.760 --> 09:29.530
Unnecessary?

09:29.530 --> 09:32.130
There is only one person I am after.

09:32.130 --> 09:36.090
As long as you do not get in my way,
that alone will suffice.

09:37.240 --> 09:39.840
As confident as ever...

09:39.840 --> 09:42.140
As you wish, then.

09:47.680 --> 09:50.720
The sacrifice today is especially beautiful.

09:50.720 --> 09:54.180
Yeah, you definitely don't see many like this.

09:56.690 --> 09:58.830
That girl is...

09:58.830 --> 10:00.360
It's as I thought.

10:00.360 --> 10:03.330
The fact that she is here means Zed is too.

10:04.800 --> 10:08.140
It seems my hunch was correct.

10:08.140 --> 10:10.760
I will have Amir Gaul without question.

10:16.280 --> 10:20.350
Our land of Tusk is the cradle of civilization.

10:20.350 --> 10:23.650
And to resurrect Great Tusker,

10:23.650 --> 10:26.620
we need the blood of shard casters!

10:30.460 --> 10:34.360
Ye who have inherited the bloodline
of mighty Tusker:

10:34.360 --> 10:37.670
I now offer a sacrifice!

10:37.670 --> 10:41.500
In so doing, we shall ensure the
resurrection of Great Tusker!

10:41.500 --> 10:49.180
Tusker! Tusker! Tusker! Tusker!

10:49.180 --> 10:55.780
Tusker! Tusker! Tusker!

10:55.780 --> 10:59.410
Tusker! Tusker!

11:08.660 --> 11:11.330
Looks like she's still out cold.

11:11.330 --> 11:13.300
Strip the sacrifice bare.

11:13.830 --> 11:16.070
Like heck you will!

11:16.070 --> 11:17.610
Give me a break!

11:17.610 --> 11:19.230
Apcarel!

11:29.380 --> 11:31.180
Damn...

11:37.360 --> 11:38.990
Apcarel!

11:45.130 --> 11:47.130
What is this place?

11:47.130 --> 11:48.800
Where the heck am I?!

11:48.800 --> 11:50.430
Zed!

11:52.770 --> 11:54.900
You're the one from before!

12:26.240 --> 12:27.870
Roya...

12:28.580 --> 12:30.200
Roya?

12:32.180 --> 12:34.780
What's the matter, Roya?

12:34.780 --> 12:36.750
I fell down...

12:36.750 --> 12:38.720
It hurts!

12:49.260 --> 12:51.100
There...

12:51.100 --> 12:54.370
That is a very effective charm.

12:54.370 --> 12:55.740
It's okay.

12:55.740 --> 12:57.860
You'll be better in no time.

13:15.460 --> 13:17.080
This is...

13:27.000 --> 13:28.630
Hey...

13:29.370 --> 13:32.010
Who are you?!

13:32.010 --> 13:33.770
That outfit...

13:33.770 --> 13:35.340
Where did you come from?!

13:35.340 --> 13:37.580
From Neotopia.

13:37.580 --> 13:40.210
Bastard! Think you'll just stroll
into our land, do you?!

13:40.680 --> 13:42.650
We'll take care of you!

14:04.140 --> 14:05.940
Say your prayers!

14:24.230 --> 14:25.660
Hey! What's wrong?

14:25.660 --> 14:27.290
Hey!

14:31.300 --> 14:34.570
It's the same sensation as before...

14:34.570 --> 14:37.740
Amir Gaul is close, there's no doubt about it.

14:37.740 --> 14:40.370
But how incredibly powerful...

14:44.110 --> 14:45.740
Go!

15:16.180 --> 15:18.140
Hey, are you okay?

15:20.550 --> 15:22.980
Yeah, I'm okay.

15:22.980 --> 15:24.950
Something wrong?

15:24.950 --> 15:27.080
Let's just get moving.

15:28.420 --> 15:30.390
Weirdo...

15:32.260 --> 15:34.060
Amir Gaul...

15:42.970 --> 15:46.610
Behold the seal of mighty Tusker!

15:46.610 --> 15:52.240
There, to be sure, is the proof of Great Tusker's
vow to descend upon this world once again!

15:52.810 --> 15:56.440
This we offer! For Great Tusker!

16:14.340 --> 16:16.960
What the heck is that?

16:18.040 --> 16:19.570
Stay back!

16:19.570 --> 16:22.870
No!

16:30.550 --> 16:31.950
What's going on?

16:31.950 --> 16:34.390
Roya! Are you all right?!

16:34.390 --> 16:36.020
Zed!

16:36.020 --> 16:38.930
Who dares interfere with the sacred rite?

16:38.930 --> 16:40.890
See that they do not leave here alive!

16:45.570 --> 16:48.030
Please don't let me down, Amir Gaul!

17:07.250 --> 17:08.960
It's you...

17:08.960 --> 17:10.720
Hugh!

17:10.720 --> 17:13.520
We meet again, boy.

17:18.000 --> 17:19.100
Hurry!

17:19.100 --> 17:20.900
Watch out!

17:23.270 --> 17:25.940
Keith, take Roya and get out
of here ahead of me!

17:25.940 --> 17:27.570
All right!

17:28.140 --> 17:29.640
Boy...

17:29.640 --> 17:32.610
Would you mind surrendering Amir Gaul to me?

17:34.080 --> 17:36.920
Amir Gaul chose me.

17:36.920 --> 17:38.990
I'm not giving him over to anyone!

17:38.990 --> 17:42.290
I see, well, that's a pity.

17:42.290 --> 17:46.250
Then, I guess you'll have to escape your
current predicament first.

18:12.250 --> 18:14.220
Kill him immediately!

18:17.390 --> 18:19.360
What now, boy?

18:20.790 --> 18:25.420
Is this all that the one whom
Amir Gaul chose has got?

18:32.310 --> 18:35.480
What spirit is that?!

18:35.480 --> 18:38.050
Th..This is...

18:38.050 --> 18:41.170
...the key spirit Sachura!

18:47.050 --> 18:49.520
What is that thing?

18:56.630 --> 18:58.870
What are these vibrations?

18:58.870 --> 19:00.370
It may be the revival of Great Tusker!

19:00.370 --> 19:02.840
No, that couldn't be.

19:02.840 --> 19:05.010
The walls are starting to cave in!

19:05.010 --> 19:07.970
What is going on here?

19:09.540 --> 19:12.010
Whoa, watch out! Run!

19:12.980 --> 19:16.480
Three key spirits are gathered here.

19:16.480 --> 19:19.120
How lucky could I be?

19:19.120 --> 19:22.420
But just who does Sachura belong to?

19:28.960 --> 19:30.560
It's...

19:30.560 --> 19:32.190
It's you...

19:34.130 --> 19:35.760
Noah!

19:36.340 --> 19:38.140
Noah, it is you, isn't it?!

19:38.140 --> 19:40.770
Yeah, it is indeed.

19:40.770 --> 19:42.880
Like heck, "it is indeed"!

19:42.880 --> 19:45.380
What are you even doing here?

19:45.380 --> 19:46.780
We'll talk later.

19:46.780 --> 19:49.020
For now, let's just get out of here.

19:49.020 --> 19:52.420
The amplified power of the
spirits can't be stopped.

19:52.420 --> 19:53.220
What?

19:53.220 --> 19:54.390
Let's go!
What?

19:54.390 --> 19:56.190
As close as I get, eh?

20:12.070 --> 20:13.470
I see...

20:13.470 --> 20:16.380
So, you're in Neotopia now.

20:16.380 --> 20:19.610
Yeah, it's a long story.

20:19.610 --> 20:22.320
There's a ton of things I want to
talk to you about though.

20:22.320 --> 20:24.690
I've got a lot myself.

20:24.690 --> 20:28.490
But for now, I must carry out my mission.

20:28.490 --> 20:29.860
Mission?

20:29.860 --> 20:32.460
Yes, there's no time.

20:32.460 --> 20:34.590
I must give priority to my mission.

20:35.930 --> 20:37.300
After that is complete,

20:37.300 --> 20:41.400
I'll put in a request to my superiors for permission
to invite you to Neotopia as my friend.

20:41.400 --> 20:43.500
What the heck do you mean, request?

20:43.500 --> 20:46.010
That's how the rules are.

20:46.010 --> 20:48.040
I've got no time to waste.

20:48.040 --> 20:50.410
Would you hand over the
escaped convict to me?

20:50.410 --> 20:52.380
Zed!

20:52.780 --> 20:54.580
Zed!

20:58.050 --> 20:59.850
That face...

21:07.760 --> 21:11.430
Thank you for the shifting shard.

21:11.430 --> 21:12.430
It's nothing.

21:12.430 --> 21:14.230
You needn't thank me.

21:14.740 --> 21:17.340
Later, Zed.

21:17.340 --> 21:19.710
I'm glad I could see you again.

21:19.710 --> 21:22.110
Me too, see you later.

21:22.110 --> 21:24.540
Take care, Keith.

21:24.540 --> 21:26.670
Sure!

21:27.480 --> 21:31.280
Noah, Keith's not a bad guy, so...

21:35.890 --> 21:38.090
I'm surprised you're still alive,

21:38.090 --> 21:42.800
let alone that you've gone over to the military.

21:42.800 --> 21:45.330
You have violated the law.

21:45.330 --> 21:47.930
That is an unpardonable crime.

21:47.930 --> 21:49.730
Not you too...

21:50.570 --> 21:53.040
So, are we going back to Neotopia?

21:53.040 --> 21:54.840
No, we're not.

21:55.480 --> 21:57.940
I have been ordered to administer your
punishment here and now.

22:29.740 --> 22:31.370
This is...

22:41.920 --> 22:44.520
Kazashita te hiraite

22:44.520 --> 22:47.360
Ano taiyou ni yararesou sa

22:47.360 --> 22:52.320
Yuuutsu na omoi wa sora ni tokashite ikou

22:52.670 --> 22:58.310
Atsui jacket nugisute hashiridashita
n da, dakara 6, 7, 8

22:58.310 --> 23:04.270
Nai kaze fukasete ima tobidashite, go!

23:09.320 --> 23:14.720
Yuriokosareta heddo okinuke
ni todoku taiyoukou

23:14.720 --> 23:18.520
Yume o hanatsu ameagari

23:20.230 --> 23:22.960
Kono michi o tobashite

23:22.960 --> 23:30.430
Ichido-kiri no ima to kodou o sagashite

23:31.100 --> 23:33.770
Tsukanda te tsukidase

23:33.770 --> 23:36.540
Ano taiyou mo kowasesou sa

23:36.540 --> 23:41.500
Yuuutsu na omoi wa sora ni tobashite ikou

23:42.020 --> 23:47.550
Try again fumidase tameratte
iru no naraba 7, 8, 9

23:47.550 --> 23:53.690
Ten made hibikaseru kono koe dashite, go!

24:16.920 --> 24:20.940
Next Time
Irrepressible Feelings

24:17.880 --> 24:20.940


Next time, "Irrepressible Feelings"
